  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【霧島温泉】天然泥湯＆源泉かけ流しにごり湯の宿6選！霧島神宮参拝と黒豚料理</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">坂本龍馬とお龍が日本初の新婚旅行で訪れたことでも知られる名湯・霧島温泉郷。もくもくと立ち上る湯煙と豊かな天然泥湯は、心と身体を芯から清らかに整えてくれます。</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-6 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/44093/44093.jpg\" alt=\"霧島温泉郷　民宿　みちや荘\" class=\"w-full md:w-48 h-36 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold text-[10px] rounded-full\">特選おすすめ</span>\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-base leading-snug\">霧島温泉郷　民宿　みちや荘</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">鹿児島県霧島市牧園町高千穂3855-118 ｜ 神宮駅・温泉駅より車で約２０分／バス利用の場合殿湯温泉より徒歩で５分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700 pt-1\">\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">⭐ 4.17（70件の評価）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">1名目安: ¥4,700〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-amber-50/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-100\">霧島温泉郷にある唯一の民宿。真心こもった霧島の山の幸をお出しします。（長期滞在割引有ります）</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-2\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D44093\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange